**/bin/
**/obj/
**/x64/*
**/x86/*
**/Win32/*
**/Release/*
**/Debug/*
**/__pycache__/*
*.dll
*.whl
**/dist
**/build
**/*.dll
**/*.egg-info/
**/.pytest_cache/

# Sphinx output. `**/build` above does not catch these: the output directory is
# `_build`, with a leading underscore. autoapi_keep_files=True also writes the
# generated API .rst back into the source tree, so docs/autoapi is generated too.
# Without these rules a sync stages ~44 MB of built HTML.
**/docs/_build/
**/docs/autoapi/
**/docs/jupyter_execute/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/

